 R←Test_Compose_06(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;text
⍝ Addresses: one without a dot in the domain is fine, an invalid one is reported instead of crashing
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Address test'
 parms.From←'Kai <kai@localhost>'
 parms.To←'admin@intranet'
 (rc msg text)←∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf'<admin@intranet>'≡text ∆Header'To'
 →T.PassesIf'Kai <kai@localhost>'≡text ∆Header'From'

 parms.CC←'good@example.com,bad@one@two.com'
 (rc msg text)←∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid email address: bad@one@two.com'≡msg

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
